  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526264",
      "title": "Teleporting Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 122,
      "videoOrder": 105,
      "sourceHash": "78defadb7e4e6c16e24d5426ba8bc88ec3208fe6eaa75211bc9caffb2ee14248",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.92,
          "en": "So what's wrong with our current error dialogue here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.92,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "Well if I open it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 10.18,
          "en": "visually, everything is all right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.18,
          "end": 12.74,
          "en": "But if I inspect this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.74,
          "end": 15.7,
          "en": "we can see a problem in the HTML mark-up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.7,
          "end": 17.66,
          "en": "Here's our dialogue right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.66,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "Its below the button input and h2 tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "And its below there, because that's where we added it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 25.843,
          "en": "in the template of Manage Goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 31.49,
          "en": "Now visually as I said everything works but semantically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.49,
          "end": 34.49,
          "en": "and from HTML perspective,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.49,
          "end": 36.27,
          "en": "having this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 38.24,
          "en": "element the dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.24,
          "end": 42.25,
          "en": "which actually is treated as overlay to the entire page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.25,
          "end": 44.35,
          "en": "Having that nested here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.35,
          "end": 46.35,
          "en": "in our HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.35,
          "end": 48.11,
          "en": "is not ideal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.11,
          "end": 51.83,
          "en": "It works but for accessibility this could be strange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.83,
          "end": 55.03,
          "en": "You could also run into some styling bugs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.03,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "and it might simply make more sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 60.301,
          "en": "if that dialogue wouldn't be down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.301,
          "end": 64.78,
          "en": "But instead lets say it would be somewhere here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.78,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "It would be inserted at the root of our HTML tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 73.51,
          "en": "And not deeply nested inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.51,
          "end": 75.44,
          "en": "Really just for semantic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.44,
          "end": 78.99,
          "en": "and also partly accessibility reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.99,
          "end": 82.42,
          "en": "And this is something which is easy to achieve with view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.42,
          "end": 84.563,
          "en": "and a feature called Teleport.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.52,
          "end": 88.61,
          "en": "Teleport, is a built in view component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.61,
          "end": 89.8,
          "en": "just like component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.8,
          "end": 90.962,
          "en": "and keep alive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.962,
          "end": 94.6,
          "en": "You can wrap your 2B teleported thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.6,
          "end": 97.57,
          "en": "so your 2B rendered somewhere else thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.57,
          "end": 99.74000000000001,
          "en": "in this case the error alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.74000000000001,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "with the built-in Teleport element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 106.983,
          "en": "Which again is a built-in component view provides to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.65,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "Now how does Teleport work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 112.78,
          "en": "or what do you with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.78,
          "end": 116.02000000000001,
          "en": "Teleport wants one prop, one attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.02000000000001,
          "end": 117.71000000000001,
          "en": "The two prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.71000000000001,
          "end": 121.15,
          "en": "And here you provide a CSS selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.15,
          "end": 124.922,
          "en": "selecting an HTML element onto your entire page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.922,
          "end": 127.81,
          "en": "where this content should actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.81,
          "end": 131.37,
          "en": "be added to in the HTML mark-up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.37,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "So logically, it still belongs to this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.96,
          "en": "you can still interact with methods in that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.96,
          "end": 138.09,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.09,
          "end": 139.41,
          "en": "But it will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.41,
          "end": 141.993,
          "en": "somewhere else in the dome's structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.96,
          "end": 144.12,
          "en": "And here for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 146.171,
          "en": "we could select the body element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.171,
          "end": 149.3,
          "en": "by just referring to the body tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.3,
          "end": 153.14,
          "en": "You could also refer to an element by an ID selector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.14,
          "end": 154.09,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.09,
          "end": 157.31,
          "en": "You just pass in a regular CSS selector here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.31,
          "end": 159.82999999999998,
          "en": "And here I'll go for the body tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.82999999999998,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "Which means, please render the content of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.8,
          "end": 167.91,
          "en": "the actual HTML mark-up that should be added to the dome",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 170.6,
          "en": "please render it in the Body element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.6,
          "end": 172.37,
          "en": "directly in the body element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.37,
          "end": 175.81,
          "en": "and not deeply nested in this HTML structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.81,
          "end": 177.483,
          "en": "as it was happening before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.24,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "So if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 182.5,
          "en": "and reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.5,
          "end": 184.44,
          "en": "and generate this dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.44,
          "end": 186.01,
          "en": "it looks like before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.01,
          "end": 189.88,
          "en": "But if we inspect this now, we see this dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.88,
          "end": 192.73,
          "en": "is now at the end of the body section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.73,
          "end": 195.26,
          "en": "And its no longer deeply nested in this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.26,
          "end": 196.813,
          "en": "div or any other elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.813,
          "end": 200.09,
          "en": "And semantically this can be better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.09,
          "end": 202.74,
          "en": "Its of course a small optimization",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.74,
          "end": 204.17000000000002,
          "en": "it might not matter to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 204.17000000000002,
          "end": 207.194,
          "en": "and you don't have to use teleport if you don't want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.194,
          "end": 210.73,
          "en": "But as you can tell it's super easy to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 210.73,
          "end": 211.87,
          "en": "And it may help you with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 211.87,
          "end": 214.23,
          "en": "the overall HTML structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.23,
          "end": 215.13,
          "en": "and ensure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 215.13,
          "end": 217.93,
          "en": "you don't just create an application that looks nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.93,
          "end": 219.41,
          "en": "and works correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 219.41,
          "end": 224.39,
          "en": "but it also uses a semantically correct HTML structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 224.39,
          "end": 225.3,
          "en": "under the wood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 225.3,
          "end": 228.503,
          "en": "And teleport makes that easy, as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
